CREATE (:Contract:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL` {Contract_size:"15.108048000000002", Description:"IN ACCORDANCE WITH FAR 43.103(A)(3) THIS SUPPLEMENTAL AGREEMENT IS ISSUED TO EXECUTE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES TO DELIVERY ORDER 1007J19016:1.THE PERIOD OF PERFORMANCE FOR A HIGH ENERGY FIXED X-RAY SYSTEM AT SAN LUIZ II LPOE (SAN LUIS, AZ) IS HEREBY EXTENDED FROM APRIL 28, 2012 TO SEPTEMBER 30, 2012.  THIS HIGH ENERGY FIXED X-RAY SYSTEM WILL BE DELIVERED ON/BEFORE AUGUST 31, 20122.THE DELIVERY SITE FOR A HIGH ENERGY FIXED X-RAY SYSTEM IS HEREBY CHANGED FROM MARIPOSA LPOE (NOGALES, AZ), AZ TO LAREDO (COLOMBIA) LPOE (LAREDO, TX).  THE HIGH ENERGY FIXED X-RAY SYSTEM WILL BE DELIVERED ON/BEFORE AUGUST 31, 2012.3.VENDOR COMPLETION OF HISTORICAL SITE SURVEY ($40,000) AND ADDITIONAL CONTROL BOOTH ($54,000) AT LAREDO (COLUMBIA) TX SITE WILL BE ASSIGNED TO THIS DELIVERY ORDER.THE ABOVE CHANGES ARE HEREBY INCORPORATED INTO DELIVERY ORDER HSBP1007J19016 AT NO COST TO THE GOVERNMENT.TOTAL DELIVERY ORDER VALUE OF $15,108,048.00 REMAINS UNCHANGED.EXCEPT AS PROVIDED HEREIN, ALL TERMS AND CONDITIONS OF THIS DELIVERY ORDER SHALL REMAIN UNCHANGED.", ID:"22056", `UNIQUE IMPORT ID`:3326});
